  ('22', 22, false, 'Students & Families', '**Families who have never signed in to the Family Portal: follow up in early November.** Re-checked 2026-10-09: 7 students'' parents not yet active. 1 KG family and 1 Grade 1 family already pinged by the President; 1 is the new KG student 10018 (letter going home with the package, #111); 3 siblings from one family are out of the country; 1 student is being withdrawn for non-attendance (see #104). Early November: re-check Admin → Parents (Last sign in) and nudge anyone still inactive on WhatsApp', 'Muneeb (Principal)', '2026-11-02', '2026-11-02', 'Waiting', null, '[]'::jsonb, now()),
