  ('D65', 65, true, 'IT', '**Portal tasks now dated in Pacific time (#115) — 2026-10-09:** `scripts/todo-sync.py` converts the portal row''s UTC `created_at` to this PC''s time zone (Pacific) for the "added from the portal" date and the Inbox file name (new `local_date()`; tested: 06:35 UTC on the 10th → 2026-10-09). Website-wide UTC audit done the same day; findings listed for the President', '', '', null, 'Done', '2026-10-09', '[]'::jsonb, now()),
  ('D64', 64, true, 'IT', '**Tasks from the phone with photos verified end-to-end (#77) — 2026-10-09:** the President added test task P1 with a photo from the phone; `todo-sync.py --pull prod --push all` copied it into TODO.md as #114, moved the photo to `records/00_Inbox/` and pushed both portals. Test row #114 closed the same night. The hourly Windows task runs fine (the 0x8007042B result code comes from the .cmd console closing; the log shows complete runs)', '', '', null, 'Done', '2026-10-09', '[]'::jsonb, now()),
  ('D63', 63, true, 'IT', '**Accept → Enroll now copies the family (#108, phase 23) — 2026-10-09:** `accept_applicant` adds father + mother (guardians), the emergency contact, and links an existing parent login by e-mail; one-time backfill run; website admission form saves the emergency contact as separate fields. Phase 23 run in dev and prod by the President; dev `7a70c73`, prod `ae64bc8`, live on the site, dev/prod diff clean', '', '', null, 'Done', '2026-10-09', '[]'::jsonb, now()),
  ('D62', 62, true, 'Students & Families', '**Create a WhatsApp group for the special-needs student: the student''s mother + class teacher + Pre-K assistant + Principal.** Purpose: daily notes both ways (how the morning went, anything the teachers should know), separate from the class group. Principal creates it, names it by the student''s first name only, and sets the ground rule (school-day messages, no photos of other children). Links with #93. — **WhatsApp group created (President, 2026-10-09)**', '', '', null, 'Done', '2026-10-09', '[]'::jsonb, now()),
  ('D61', 61, true, 'Finance', '**Late-fee chase for the KG student who started 09-16 (#102) — resolved 2026-10-07 without a chase:** the family sent $450 by Zelle on 10-07; posted as $150 for September (one-off reduced rate approved by the President 2026-10-06 for the mid-month start) and $300 for October (see D58). Nothing outstanding for this family. **Carried forward:** the other KG student''s fee waiver (September $100 marked waived 10-06 as a non-cash payment row) — at the October close waive October the same way if unpaid, and exclude both waiver rows from income when matching the portal to QBO; a proper *Waived* status is #105. Was #102.', '', '', null, 'Done', '2026-10-08', '[]'::jsonb, now()),
  ('D60', 60, true, 'IT', '**Digital admission forms closed out (#73) — 2026-10-08:** amended phase 18 re-run in prod (office saves count as reviewed; 10015''s three forms now show Completed with no flag), Brevo API key stored as Vault secret `brevo_api_key` in prod and dev (test e-mails received in the school Gmail → instant alerts for medical changes, consent withdrawal and new volunteer applications are live), dev brought level with phases 17 + 18. 10005''s three forms still carry "Updated by parent — review" because the father''s active account re-saved them after the office entry — a genuine flag: Principal opens each (View / edit), checks the answers, clicks Mark reviewed', '', '', null, 'Done', '2026-10-08', '[]'::jsonb, now()),
  ('D59', 59, true, 'Finance', '**Payroll tax authorisations and WA registrations confirmed 2026-10-07 (President signed in to QBO and EAMS, Claude checked):** federal e-pay/e-file active (Intuit e-mail 10-01); QBO Payroll Overview "We''re all set to do your taxes", Tax Center shows nothing due; e-services carry EIN, UBI, L&I 511674-00 and ESD 000961119-00-5; **WA Workers'' Comp complete** (account ID entered, classes 6103-01 and 6104-01 active, rates from 10/01/2026); **EAMS shows every quarter from Q3 2025 to Q3 2026 "Report filed"**, Q4 2026 opens 12-14. Post-payroll check moved to #107. Was #80. (filed: records/03_Washington State - ESD (Unemployment)/02. Quarterly Reports/2026-10-07_EAMS_Quarterly-Reports-Status_Q3-2025-to-Q3-2026-all-filed.jpg)', '', '', null, 'Done', '2026-10-07', '[]'::jsonb, now()),
  ('D58', 58, true, 'Finance', '**Student 10017 (KG): $450 Zelle of 2026-10-07 posted as two payments — $150 dated 2026-09-30 (September at the one-off reduced rate approved by the President 2026-10-06, late start 09-16) and $300 dated 2026-10-07 (October).** The alert arrived 05:57; the office matched it as one $450 row at 06:43; Claude split it per the instruction. QuickBooks: the $450 deposit posts once from the bank feed to Tuition Income with the $150 September discount as contra-income — do it with the October bank-feed batch (needs the President signed in). Was #106.', '', '', null, 'Done', '2026-10-07', '[]'::jsonb, now()),
  ('D57', 57, true, 'Finance', '**#32 closed without action (President, 2026-10-06): no Treasurer QBO seat for now** — Treasurer Nuruddin Alam has declined to give time, so the President manages all finances personally. Reopen when an active Treasurer (or any second financial officer) exists: QBO Plus has 4 spare user seats (Settings → Manage users → Company admin) plus the free Accountant seat (Settings → My Accountant), two minutes to set up. Governance note: the bylaws'' Treasurer duties (quarterly reports to the board, reimbursement approvals over $200) currently fall to the President in practice — worth acknowledging in the #4/#46 board consent so the paper matches reality', '', '', null, 'Done', '2026-10-06', '[]'::jsonb, now()),
  ('D56', 56, true, 'Finance', '**ESD unemployment coverage decided: stay CONTRIBUTORY (#21, President 2026-10-06)** — pay the quarterly UI tax (1.31% for 2026 on the first $78,200/employee) rather than reimbursing ESD dollar-for-dollar for any future claims; capped premium ≈ $157/mo on target payroll is cheap insurance for a five-person first-year payroll. Nothing to change: contributory is the ESD default, the school is already registered that way, and QBO Payroll already carries WA UI 1.29% + EAF 0.02%; FUTA exemption (501c3) was already set. Decision note: `notes/decisions/2026-10-06-esd-contributory-election.md`. #21 was the last of the two-part task', '', '', null, 'Done', '2026-10-06', '[]'::jsonb, now()),
  ('D55', 55, true, 'Legal & Compliance', '**Three Gmail confirmations filed into records (#85):** FileLocal/Kent business-license application 9HXEXY4Q (09-24) + its Originator-ID companion e-mail → `01_Corporate & Legal/03. Registrations & Certificates/2026-09-24_FileLocal_…9HXEXY4Q.md` (ACH Originator IDs 0000007041 / 1020401225 also added to accounts.md — the bank needs them or FileLocal e-payments are blocked); L&I Q3 2026 report e-mail confirmation 12648251 (09-30) → `04_…L&I/03. Quarterly Reports/`; Intuit "E-pay and e-file are active" (federal payroll authorization approved; WA agencies still pending, #80) → `05_Payroll…/01. Payroll Setup/`. Gmail label **Filed** created (D46 had planned it but it never existed) and applied to all four threads', '', '', null, 'Done', '2026-10-06', '[]'::jsonb, now()),
  ('D54', 54, true, 'Finance', '**September 2026 close COMPLETE (#33) — both bank accounts formally reconciled, difference $0.00 (2026-10-05/06):** …8048 reconciled through 09-30 (statement $4,771.57, auto-imported and attached by QBO); **Zakat …9334 reconciled through 09-30** ($1,038.00, zero activity since the 03-25 opening transfer; all seven statements Mar–Sep filed in `08_Financials/02. 2026/01. Bank Statements/`). All eight portal tuition payments matched bank↔portal↔QBO; three unknown deposits confirmed as donations by the President and posted ($5,000 counter 09-11, $500 Zelle donor, $50 Zelle donor → September donations $5,875); one former family''s $1,500 = 2025-26 fees in arrears (not enrolled 2026-27; QBO Tuition, close-note documented); the missing $25 ESD late fee was paid personally by the President → Journal Entry #3 (09-21): Dr Government Fees & Licenses / Cr Donation Income - General (in-kind donation). Follow-ups split out: #102 (unpaid families), #103 (acknowledgment letters). Close note: `records/08_Financials/02. 2026/05. Revenue Reports/2026-10-06_September-2026_Close_Note.md`', '', '', null, 'Done', '2026-10-06', '[]'::jsonb, now()),
  ('D53', 53, true, 'Finance', '**September contractor pay posted in QBO (#79) — 2026-10-05:** bank feed refreshed in the pane (now through 10-02); all five 09-30 debits ($2,000 · $1,000 · $750 · $1,000 · $2,000 = $6,750) posted to Contract Labor - Teachers (1099), class Tuition Program, each to the correct contractor vendor with 1099 tracking (QBO''s suggestion of "BofA Zakat Checking" on the $1,000 bank-transfer payment was corrected before posting — it was pay, not a Zakat transfer). No BofA e-mail alerts exist for outgoing payments, so a dated payment-record note (amount, method, confirmation # from the feed, QBO posting) was filed in each teacher''s `03. Payments` folder instead. Feed also now shows the $220.80 Intuit charge (#86) and the first October tuition receipts (October close)', '', '', null, 'Done', '2026-10-05', '[]'::jsonb, now()),
  ('D52', 52, true, 'IT', '**Dashboard tiles (2026-10-05, prod `6cb5a85` / `65e2b98`):** "Class updates this week" — Mon–Sun, one box per grade listing only the subjects with a post, small grade dot, site-theme colours, click opens Class Updates; fees tile now "Fees this month" with Paid (green) and Unpaid (red, grey when zero); "Volunteers in progress" tile; Present/Absent Today tiles link to the new Attendance page', '', '', null, 'Done', '2026-10-05', '[]'::jsonb, now()),
  ('D50', 50, true, 'IT', '**Volunteer program online (#95) — live on prod 2026-10-05** (dev `947620b`, prod `bc33e91`, phase 22 run in dev and prod): `falahacademywa.org/volunteer.html` (availability grid, interests, experience, two references, disclosures, consent, under-18 parent block, résumé upload PDF/Word 5 MB to the private `volunteer-docs` bucket, inline validation, honeypot); nav "Get Involved ▾" (Events, Volunteer With Us) replacing the Events link on all 15 pages + footer link + sitemap; home rotator (School in Session · Admissions Open · "Volunteer and Earn Lasting Reward", 8 s, pauses, dots, reduced-motion safe). Admin → Volunteers: New → Contacted → Screening → Approved → Active / Declined / Withdrawn, dialog with every answer, six dated screening checks, assigned class, notes, paper-clip résumé via signed URL; staff module `volunteers`; Dashboard tile. Every admin alerted at once (e-mail immediate once the Brevo Vault key exists). Later the same day: gender radio (Female/Male, required; `gender` column), DOB sanity check, inline validation on blur, paper-clip résumé pill. Tested by the President in dev and prod (prod `8e1e10b`). WhatsApp call drafted: `marketing/whatsapp/2026-10_volunteer-call.md`', '', '', null, 'Done', '2026-10-05', '[]'::jsonb, now()),
